+PERSON
+  ↓
+IDENTITY ACCOUNT
+  ↓
+AUTHENTICATION
+  ↓
+ACTOR CONTEXT
+  ↓
+AUTHORIZATION DECISION
+```
+
+A person can participate in multiple domains simultaneously without creating duplicate identity records.
